# Unity: generated folders and IDE files (only Assets/, Packages/ and ProjectSettings/ are kept)
**/Library/
**/Temp/
**/Logs/
**/obj/
**/Build/
**/Builds/
**/Build*/
**/UserSettings/
**/MemoryCaptures/
**/*.csproj
**/*.sln
**/*.slnx
**/*.pidb
**/*.userprefs
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/.DS_Store

# generated by scripts/unity-export/export-all.mjs (every world, the shared store, the characters) and
# recorded by scripts/unity-export/record-sounds.mjs (needs a dev server): run them before opening the project
Memento/Assets/StreamingAssets/*
